// 安装进度卡片（下载页底部 / 向导进度步共用）：阶段 + 进度条 + 文件/字节/速度/剩余 + 取消。
import { Theme } from "../theme/tokens.slint";
import { Metrics } from "../theme/metrics.slint";
import { UiInstallProgress, InstallStage } from "../models.slint";
import { UiText, TextRole } from "../components/label.slint";
import { ProgressBar } from "../components/progress-bar.slint";
import { AppIcon, IconKind } from "../components/icons.slint";
import { MetroButton, ButtonKind } from "../widgets/button.slint";

export component InstallPanel inherits Rectangle {
    in property <UiInstallProgress> data;
    callback cancel();

    height: 96px;
    visible: root.data.visible;
    background: Theme.bg-surface;
    border-width: 1px;
    border-color: Theme.stroke;

    VerticalLayout {
        padding: Metrics.gap-3;
        spacing: Metrics.gap-1;

        HorizontalLayout {
            spacing: Metrics.gap-2;

            AppIcon {
                icon-size: 16px;
                kind: root.data.failed ? IconKind.error
                    : root.data.terminal ? IconKind.check
                    : IconKind.download;
                tint: root.data.failed ? Theme.state-danger
                    : root.data.terminal ? Theme.state-success
                    : Theme.accent;
            }
            UiText {
                role: TextRole.bodyStrong;
                text: root.data.instance + " · " + root.data.loader;
                horizontal-stretch: 1;
            }
            UiText {
                role: TextRole.caption;
                text: root.data.stage_label;
                color: root.data.failed ? Theme.state-danger : Theme.fg-secondary;
            }
            if !root.data.terminal : MetroButton {
                kind: ButtonKind.subtle;
                text: "取消";
                button-height: 24px;
                clicked => { root.cancel(); }
            }
        }

        ProgressBar {
            ratio: root.data.ratio;
            known: root.data.known;
        }

        HorizontalLayout {
            spacing: Metrics.gap-3;
            UiText {
                role: TextRole.caption;
                text: root.data.message;
                horizontal-stretch: 1;
                overflow: elide;
            }
            UiText { role: TextRole.caption; text: root.data.files_label; }
            UiText { role: TextRole.caption; text: root.data.bytes_label; }
            UiText { role: TextRole.caption; text: root.data.speed; color: Theme.accent; }
            UiText { role: TextRole.caption; text: root.data.eta; }
        }
    }
}
